#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Polkit GNOME"
msgstr "Instalação do Polkit GNOME"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, apply some fixes that allow for the proper user icon to be used, as "
"well as some security fixes:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, aplique algumas correções que permitem que o ícone adequado de "
"usante seja usado, bem como algumas correções de segurança:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:102
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../polkit-gnome-&polkit-gnome-"
"version;-consolidated_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../polkit-gnome-&polkit-gnome-"
"version;-consolidated_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Polkit GNOME</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Polkit GNOME</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:109
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:120
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Polkit GNOME"
msgstr "Configurando o Polkit GNOME"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Automatic Startup"
msgstr "Iniciação Automática"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For the authentication framework to work, <command>polkit-gnome-"
"authentication-agent-1</command> needs to be started. However, <command>make"
" install</command> did not install a startup file for the "
"<application>Polkit GNOME</application> so you have to create it by "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"Para que a estrutura de autenticação funcione, <command>polkit-gnome-"
"authentication-agent-1</command> precisa ser iniciado. No entanto, "
"<command>make install</command> não instalou um arquivo de iniciação para o "
"<application>Polkit GNOME</application>, de modo que você tem de criá-lo "
"você mesmo(a)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Issue the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to create a startup file for "
"<application>Polkit GNOME</application>:"
msgstr ""
"Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> para criar um arquivo de iniciação para"
" <application>Polkit GNOME</application>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/polkit-gnome.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p /etc/xdg/autostart &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/xdg/autostart/polkit-gnome-authentication-agent-1.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=PolicyKit Authentication Agent\n"
"Comment=PolicyKit Authentication Agent\n"
"Exec=/usr/libexec/polkit-gnome-authentication-agent-1\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=\n"
"NoDisplay=true\n"
"OnlyShowIn=GNOME;XFCE;Unity;\n"
"AutostartCondition=GNOME3 unless-session gnome</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p /etc/xdg/autostart &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/xdg/autostart/polkit-gnome-authentication-agent-1.desktop &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=PolicyKit Authentication Agent\n"
"Comment=PolicyKit Authentication Agent\n"
"Exec=/usr/libexec/polkit-gnome-authentication-agent-1\n"
"Terminal=false\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"Categories=\n"
"NoDisplay=true\n"
"OnlyShowIn=GNOME;XFCE;Unity;\n"
"AutostartCondition=GNOME3 unless-session gnome</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

